a class=\"rounded-full bg-brand-500 px-4 py-1.5 font-medium text-white shadow-sm transition-colors hover:bg-brand-600\" href=\"/#waitlist\">Get the app</a></nav></div></header><main class=\"min-h-[70vh]\"><section class=\"mx-auto max-w-5xl px-5 pb-24 pt-20 text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-500\">Your closet, styled by AI</p><h1 class=\"mx-auto mt-5 max-w-3xl text-balance font-serif text-5xl italic leading-[1.05] tracking-tight sm:text-7xl\">Wear what you own, better.</h1><p class=\"mx-auto mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg text-foreground/70\">Cherly turns photos of your real clothes into a personal stylist — outfits for your actual life, never a suggestion you don&#x27;t already own.</p><div class=\"mt-10\" id=\"waitlist\"><form class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-md flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row\"><input type=\"email\" required=\"\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\" class=\"flex-1 rounded-full border border-line bg-surface px-5 py-3 outline-none transition focus:border-brand-500 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-500/15\" name=\"email\"/><button type=\"submit\" class=\"rounded-full bg-brand-500 px-6 py-3 font-medium text-white shadow-artsy transition-colors hover:bg-brand-600 disabled:opacity-50\">Join the waitlist</button></form></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto max-w-5xl px-5\"><div class=\"grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"rounded-3xl border border-line bg-surface p-7 shadow-artsy\"><p class=\"font-serif text-4xl italic text-brand-700\">1</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 font-serif text-2xl italic tracking-tight\">Snap your closet</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-foreground/70\">Photograph your clothes once. Cherly cuts them out, tags them — colour, fabric, formality, warmth — and builds your digital wardrobe.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-3xl border border-line bg-surface p-7 shadow-artsy\"><p class=\"font-serif text-4xl italic text-brand-700\">2</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 font-serif text-2xl italic tracking-tight\">Ask what to wear</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-foreground/70\">Dinner Thursday? Cherly reads your event, the weather, and your taste, then proposes complete outfits from clothes you actually own.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-3xl border border-line bg-surface p-7 shadow-artsy\"><p class=\"font-serif text-4xl italic text-brand-700\">3</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 font-serif text-2xl italic tracking-tight\">Swipe to swap</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-foreground/70\">Not feeling the top? Reroll just that slot. Save the winner, log the wear, and watch Cherly learn what you love.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto max-w-5xl px-5 py-24 text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-500\">Cherly Pro</p><h2 class=\"mt-4 font-serif text-4xl italic tracking-tight\">The stylist that knows your closet</h2><p class=\"mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-foreground/70\">Free gets you the full daily loop on a starter closet. Pro unlocks the intelligence — for less than one impulse buy a month.</p><ul class=\"mx-auto mt-10 grid max-w-2xl gap-3 text-left sm:grid-cols-2\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface px-4 py-3.5 text-sm shadow-artsy\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inline-block size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand-500\"></span>Unlimited closet &amp; unlimited styling</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface px-4 py-3.5 text-sm shadow-artsy\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inline-block size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand-500\"></span>Calendar + weather planning, every morning</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface px-4 py-3.5 text-sm shadow-artsy\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inline-block size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand-500\"></span>Wardrobe analytics &amp; cost-per-wear</li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface px-4 py-3.5 text-sm shadow-artsy\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inline-block size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand-500\"></span>Closet gaps &amp; smarter shopping</li></ul></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"mt-24 border-t border-line\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-5xl flex-col gap-6 px-5 py-10 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between\"><div><p class=\"font-serif text-xl italic text-brand-700\">Cherly</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-foreground/50\">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> <!-- -->Cherly<!-- --> · <!-- -->Your closet, styled by AI.</p></div><nav class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-2 text-sm\"><a class=\"text-foreground/60 transition-colors hover:text-foreground\" href=\"/legal/privacy\">Privacy</a><a class=\"text-foreground/60 transition-colors hover:text-foreground\" href=\"/legal/terms\">Terms</a><a class=\"text-foreground/60 transition-colors hover:text-foreground\" href=\"/support\">Support</a><a class=\"text-foreground/60 transition-colors hover:text-foreground\" href=\"/support/delete-account\">Delete account</a></nav></div></footer><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3yiddnbtmgj46.js?dpl=dpl_2cHwHoT8cpbtWpDFw1rADLbhHx5f\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/05-c3ty_6dwfk.js?dpl=dpl_2cHwHoT8cpbtWpDFw1rADLbhHx5f\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js?dpl=dpl_2cHwHoT8cpbtWpDFw1rADLbhHx5f\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n3:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/05-c3ty_6dwfk.js?dpl=dpl_2cHwHoT8cpbtWpDFw1rADLbhHx5f\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js?dpl=dpl_2cHwHoT8cpbtWpDFw1rADLbhHx5f\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[22016,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/05-c3ty_6dwfk.js?dpl=dpl_2cHwHoT8cpbtWpDFw1rADLbhHx5f\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js?dpl=dpl_2cHwHoT8cpbtWpDFw1rADLbhHx5f\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1rxncug86bump.js?dpl=dpl_2cHwHoT8cpbtWpDFw1rADLbhHx5f\\\"],\\\"\\\"]\\n8:I[68027,[\\\"/_next/stati